    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Represents restricted shares of Class A Common Stock granted under the Health In Tech, Inc. Equity Incentive Plan (the &quot;Plan&quot;) pursuant to a Restricted Stock Award Agreement dated as of October 20, 2026. The grant was contingent upon, and the shares were issued upon, stockholder approval of an amendment to the Plan at the Issuer's 2026 Annual Meeting of Stockholders on November 10, 2026. The shares vest in twelve equal monthly installments commencing November 15, 2026, subject to continued service through each vesting date.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Represents restricted shares of Class A Common Stock that vest in full upon the closing of an acquisition by the Issuer on or before December 31, 2028, subject to continued service through such closing, and are otherwise forfeited without consideration.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">Represents restricted shares of Class A Common Stock that are forfeited without consideration unless the Issuer's market capitalization (measured by 10-day VWAP) exceeds $150 million on or before April 30, 2028 (the &quot;Achievement Date&quot;). Thereafter, the shares vest in twelve equal monthly installments, subject to continued service, commencing on the 15th of the month if the Achievement Date is before the 15th, or otherwise on the 1st of the next month.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">Represents restricted shares of Class A Common Stock that are forfeited without consideration unless the Issuer's market capitalization (measured by 10-day VWAP) exceeds $300 million on or before December 31, 2028 (the &quot;Achievement Date&quot;). Thereafter, the shares vest in twelve equal monthly installments, subject to continued service, commencing on the 15th of the month if the Achievement Date is before the 15th, or otherwise on the 1st of the next month.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F5">Represents restricted shares of Class A Common Stock that are forfeited without consideration unless the Issuer's market capitalization (measured by 10-day VWAP) exceeds $500 million on or before December 31, 2029 (the &quot;Achievement Date&quot;). Thereafter, the shares vest in twelve equal monthly installments, subject to continued service, commencing on the 15th of the month if the Achievement Date is before the 15th, or otherwise on the 1st of the next month.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F6">Represents restricted shares of Class A Common Stock that are forfeited without consideration unless the Issuer's market capitalization (measured by 10-day VWAP) exceeds $1 billion on or before December 31, 2031 (the &quot;Achievement Date&quot;). Thereafter, the shares vest in twelve equal monthly installments, subject to continued service, commencing on the 15th of the month if the Achievement Date is before the 15th, or otherwise on the 1st of the next month.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F7">Represents restricted shares of Class B Common Stock on the terms described in footnote (3).</footnote>
        <footnote id="F8">Includes 3,828,516 restricted shares of Class A Common Stock and 8,138,635 unrestricted shares of Class A Common Stock. Excludes 200,000 restricted shares of Class B Common Stock, 2,700,000 shares of Class B Common Stock and 711,510 options to purchase shares of Class A Common Stock.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F9">All unvested restricted shares reported herein vest in full upon a Change in Control (as defined in the Plan).</footnote>
    </footnotes>

